  "details": "Lately, it seems like this new Avatar Dynamics update has opened the doors to many new exploits, as one of my friends' Friends world instance has been getting ferociously attacked with crashers and exploiters. We counted 62 individual people who came in to cause a crapshow. Before the new update, we did not have any types of crashers/mic spammers for around 3 weeks. Yet, somehow they were able to come in and cause mayhem. They were more than likely using modified clients with some sort of feature to join by the instance id. But the fact it only now has gone through the roof is very concerning.",
